      "text": "facts; it does not invent or calculate them. What happens to my conversation? By default, completed turns live only in session storage in this browser tab and clear with the browser session. If you are signed in, you can explicitly remember a conversation for 90 days. Its expiry is fixed, and you can delete one thread, delete all threads, or opt out at any time. What is sent when I attach a chart? You choose a saved chart, keep attachment off by default, and review the exact positions-only payload before consenting. Names, chart IDs, birth dates, times, places, and coordinates are never sent to OpenAI. What will it not do? It does not provide medical, legal, financial, or crisis advice, and it does not present astrology as a certain prediction. In those areas it keeps the astrology symbolic and points you toward appropriate real-world help."
