      "title": "Compatibility Calculator — Compare Two Birth Charts",
      "heading": "Check your astrology compatibility.",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Two charts, honestly compared Check your astrology compatibility. See where the relationship flows, where it catches, and what each person brings out in the other. Enter two birth charts for a reading you can actually use. Astrologers call this comparison synastry In plain English Synastry Synastry compares placements in two natal charts, keeping both charts intact rather than blending them into one. Learn more about Synastry → . Person A Name optional Birth date Birth time I don't know it Birthplace Person B Name optional Birth date Birth time I don't know it Birthplace Compare the charts ↗ Private by default. Your birth details stay in this browser. Charts you calculate and"
