      "text": "The month's peak and its reset, each an exact instant. the full moon calendar · tonight's phase Eclipses Lunations with exact aim — the years' hinge dates. every eclipse through 2028 ℞ Retrogrades and stations Apparent reversals and the standstill days that bound them. every window, dated · the Mercury story Sign changes A slow planet entering a new sign — scenery that lasts years. track them against your chart Rare alignments Exact angles between the slow movers, years in the making. how aspects work How to use this calendar Skim the month you are in, note the two or three dates ahead, and open the ones that name a sign that matters to you — your Sun sign , your rising sign , or anything prominent in your birth chart . Every event page says what the moment is, when it is exact, and what the tradition makes of it — and the daily horoscopes carry each one into day-by-day readings as"
