      "text": "Plain English first The astrology glossary. Start with a simple explanation, then open the precise definition when you want it. Search abbreviations such as Rx In plain English Retrograde motion A period when a planet appears to move backward from Earth; it has not reversed its orbit. Learn more about Retrograde motion → , ASC In plain English Ascendant The exact point rising on the eastern horizon, often shortened to ASC. Learn more about Ascendant → , or MC In plain English Midheaven (MC) A chart angle associated with public life and direction, often shortened to MC. Learn more about Midheaven (MC) → , too. 145 terms · English Find an answer What did you come across? 145 terms shown Search a word or abbreviation Filter by topic All topics Chart setup Chart anatomy Aspects Dignities Timing Sign qualities More astrology terms Clear filters New to astrology? Start with these terms"
