      "locale": "en",
      "text": "position method → Applying aspect # Aspects An aspect moving closer to its exact angle. Precise definition An aspect is applying when the moving positions are drawing closer to the aspect’s exact angle. The natal engine determines this from relative longitude speed; fixed-chart synastry does not assign applying or separating status. Related Separating aspect · Exact aspect · Aspect Aquarius # Aquarius is the eleventh tropical sign, spanning 300° through just under 330° of zodiac longitude. It is a fixed air day sign ruled by Uranus in the modern table and Saturn in the classical table. Related Air · Fixed · Uranus · Saturn · Eleventh house Read the Aquarius guide → Aries # Aries is the first tropical sign, spanning 0° through just under 30° of zodiac longitude. It is a cardinal fire day sign ruled by Mars in both modern and classical tables. Related Fire · Cardinal · Mars · First house"
