      "text": "place are known, angles and houses. Related Placement · Aspect · House · Angle Calculate a birth chart → C Cancer # Cancer is the fourth tropical sign, spanning 90° through just under 120° of zodiac longitude. It is a cardinal water night sign ruled by the Moon in both modern and classical tables. Related Water · Cardinal · Moon · Fourth house Read the Cancer guide → Capricorn # Capricorn is the tenth tropical sign, spanning 270° through just under 300° of zodiac longitude. It is a cardinal earth night sign ruled by Saturn in both modern and classical tables. Related Earth · Cardinal · Saturn · Tenth house Read the Capricorn guide → Cardinal # Sign qualities The modality associated with beginning, initiating, and setting direction. Precise definition Cardinal is the modality of Aries, Cancer, Libra, and Capricorn. These four signs begin the tropical seasons and are read through"
