      "locale": "en",
      "text": "initiation and direction. Related Aries · Cancer · Libra · Capricorn · Modality Chart ruler # The chart ruler is the planet that classically rules the rising sign. This site uses traditional rulership for that label, so a known ascendant is required. Related Rising sign · Ascendant · Classical ruler · Rulership Find the chart ruler → Classical ruler # A classical ruler comes from the seven-body rulership scheme used before Uranus, Neptune, and Pluto were discovered. This site keeps that table for chart rulers, decans, and traditional dignity calculations. Related Modern ruler · Rulership · Essential dignity Compare sign rulers → Composite chart # A composite chart places symbolic points at the midpoints of two natal charts and treats the result as a chart of the relationship. This site computes inter-chart synastry, not composite charts. Related Synastry · Bi-wheel · Inter-chart aspect"
