      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Ecliptic latitude # Ecliptic latitude is angular distance north or south of the ecliptic plane. The engine retains it for body positions, but sign and house placement on this site use zodiac longitude. Related Ecliptic · Zodiac longitude · Placement · Declination Read the coordinate method → Eighth house # The eighth house covers shared resources, debt, inheritance, dependency, and changes that cannot be handled alone. It stands opposite the second house, placing joint obligations across from personal holdings. Related Second house · House Read the eighth-house guide → Element # Sign qualities A sign family—fire, earth, air, or water—used to describe its basic style. Precise definition Element is a four-part classification that groups the signs as fire, earth, air, or water. Each element contains one cardinal, one fixed, and one mutable sign. Related Fire · Earth · Air · Water ·"
