      "locale": "en",
      "text": "uncertain values. Related Birth chart (natal chart) · Angle · House Calculate a chart → North Node # Chart anatomy A calculated point where the Moon’s orbit crosses the Sun’s apparent path, often read as a direction of growth rather than a fixed destiny. Precise definition The North Node is the ascending intersection where the Moon’s orbit crosses from south to north of the ecliptic. This site computes its true, instantaneous position and places the South Node opposite it. Related South Node · True node · Lunar nodes O Opposition # Aspects A 180° aspect that places two chart points across from one another. Precise definition An opposition places two chart bodies across the zodiac from one another. Its exact angular separation is 180°, and this site reads it through polarity, encounter, and competing demands. Exact 180° · natal orb ≤ 8° · with Sun or Moon ≤ 10° Related Aspect · Orb ·"
