      "text": "See every retrograde through 2027. All eight planets that do it, 2026 through 2027 — each window computed station to station from real motion, with the degree where each turnaround happens. Mercury three or four times a year, about three weeks each Window Stations retrograde at Stations direct at Feb 26, 2026 – Mar 20, 2026 22°33′ Pisces 8°29′ Pisces Jun 29, 2026 – Jul 23, 2026 26°15′ Cancer 16°19′ Cancer Oct 24, 2026 – Nov 13, 2026 20°58′ Scorpio 5°02′ Scorpio Feb 9, 2027 – Mar 3, 2027 5°58′ Pisces 20°55′ Aquarius Jun 10, 2027 – Jul 4, 2027 6°21′ Cancer 27°28′ Gemini Oct 7, 2027 – Oct 28, 2027 4°55′ Scorpio 19°18′ Libra Jan 24, 2028 – Feb 14, 2028 19°41′ Aquarius 3°59′ Aquarius May 21, 2028 – Jun 14, 2028 16°18′ Gemini 7°45′ Gemini Sep 19, 2028 – Oct 11, 2028 18°35′ Libra 3°28′ Libra Jan 7, 2029 – Jan 27, 2029 3°38′ Aquarius"
