      "heading": "Sagittarius",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "associate with growth, luck, and the appetite for more: more meaning, more distance, more of the map. It's the largest planet in the solar system, which is both the joke and the point. When you read about Jupiter in your own chart, you're reading about the engine Sagittarius runs on full-time. Send this page: X · WhatsApp · Telegram · Email The essentials Dates Nov 22 – Dec 21 Element Fire Modality Mutable Ruling planet Jupiter Polarity Day (yang) Natural house 9th Principal star Kaus Australis — “the southern bow” — ε Sagittarii Babylonian record PA.BIL.SAG — the winged archer-god, bow drawn on Antares Look up your exact birthday → Is Sagittarius your sun sign? Get your birth chart — moon, rising, planets, and all — then save what matters. Get your free birth chart ↗ ← Previous Scorpio Fellow fire signs Aries Leo Next → Capricorn"
