      "text": "to Scorpio as proof of seriousness. The charged pairings are Leo and Aquarius , which square Scorpio and argue about privacy, principle, and who gets the last word, and Taurus , the opposite sign — the classic attraction of the depths to the solid ground. Charged doesn’t mean doomed; oppositions are some of the most durable matches in astrology precisely because each partner carries what the other lacks. Sun signs are the first sentence of that story, not the whole book — a real comparison looks at both full charts. Scorpio in your chart Everyone has Scorpio somewhere in their birth chart — the question is what part of your life it runs. Scorpio Sun Identity organizes around depth: you feel most yourself in the true conversation, the full commitment, the work that transforms something — including you. The lifelong lesson is that control is not the same as safety, and"
