      "locale": "en",
      "text": "was never the price of being loved. Scorpio Moon Your emotional weather runs deep and pressurized. Feelings arrive at full strength, get processed in private, and surface days later as a settled position. People with Scorpio Moons feel everything and display almost none of it, which reads as calm right up until it doesn’t. Find your Moon sign if you don’t know it — it takes about twenty seconds. Scorpio Rising The room meets your gravity before it meets you. Scorpio Rising people read as composed, magnetic, and slightly unreadable — strangers either confide immediately or sit up straighter, and nobody stays neutral. You’ve been called intimidating by people you were being nice to. Read the full Scorpio Rising profile . Your Rising sign depends on your exact birth time — calculate yours here . Want all three at once, plus every planet? Get your free birth chart —"
