      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Placements ♃ Jupiter in Libra Classical standing neutral — no special dignity In plain English Essential dignity A traditional system for describing how supported a planet is considered in a sign. Learn more about Essential dignity → here Half the doors in this biography were opened by somebody else, and that isn’t a confession — it’s the method. Jupiter in Libra grows through other people, and it has made being easy to help into a quiet form of craft. How it shows up Jupiter marks where doors open with less shoving, and in Libra they open because someone is holding them. The operating assumption is that people are reachable: the stranger is a future collaborator, the opposing view a future compromise, the awkward dinner one good question away from working. Enter enough rooms expecting alliance and alliances accumulate —"
