      "text": "dissolving somewhere: the retreat, the coastline without an itinerary, trips measured in states of mind rather than sights seen. This is the placement most likely to call a week of doing nothing by the water the most productive of its year, and to be right. The generosity is the widest register in the zodiac: the coat, the couch, the last seat, the benefit of every doubt, handed to the person in front of it without an interview. Some of it is wasted. This placement decided long ago that the waste is part of the practice, and it is difficult to argue with the results. The growth edge Jupiter’s too-much, in Pisces, is dissolution. Yes said past empty; other people’s sorrows brought home like strays; the self’s own outline going faint from disuse. Escape upgrades itself from a break into an address — the long sleep, the third rewatch, whatever"
