      "heading": "Mercury in Aries",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "they’re right slowly, and talking over them costs information. The sky schedules the delay three times a year anyway. The Mercury retrograde calendar lists the exact review windows — treat them as maintenance for the send button, and run your birth chart to see which house takes the fast talk. Part of how your chart talks — the communication guide → Asked and answered What does Mercury in Aries mean? Mercury describes how you think and talk; Aries runs both at ignition speed. People with this placement speak in first drafts, decide quickly, and learn by doing rather than by reading ahead. The style is direct, fast, and allergic to preamble. I’m a Pisces. Can my Mercury really be in Aries? Yes, and it’s common. Mercury never sits more than one sign from the Sun, so a Pisces Sun comes with Mercury in Aquarius, Pisces, or Aries. That particular"
