      "heading": "Mercury in Aries",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "pairing puts a soft center behind a surprisingly fast mouth. Why do Mercury in Aries people interrupt so much? Because the thought arrives finished and feels urgent. Interrupting here is rarely contempt — it’s enthusiasm with bad brakes. The workable fix is a notebook: park the point, let the other sentence land, then fire. Is Mercury in Aries good in an argument? Devastating in the first five minutes, weaker in hour two. It wins openings with speed and nerve, then loses interest once the fight turns into a siege. Pair it with someone who reads the fine print and you have a complete negotiation. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Pisces All placements Taurus → More in Aries ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
