      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Placements ☿ Mercury in Capricorn Classical standing neutral — no special dignity In plain English Essential dignity A traditional system for describing how supported a planet is considered in a sign. Learn more about Essential dignity → here The email is four lines long, and the fourth line is the deadline. Mercury in Capricorn writes like postage still costs money — and somehow it never reads as rude, only as finished. How it shows up Mercury is the chart’s thinking and talking; Capricorn runs both like operations. Problems get decomposed, sequenced, and scheduled — this mind doesn’t brainstorm so much as triage. It learns inside structures: give it the map, the syllabus, the standard, and it climbs them in order, verifying credentials as it goes. The wit is dry and placed —"
