      "heading": "Mercury in Capricorn",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "who owns it. Enthusiasm gets treated as a claim awaiting proof, which saves this Mercury from most fads and costs it a few good early calls. Reversals happen — they just require new facts, not new feelings. I’m a Sagittarius. Why is my Mercury in Capricorn? Because Mercury never strays more than one sign from the Sun: Sagittarius Suns get Mercury in Scorpio, Sagittarius, or Capricorn. The Sagittarius-Sun, Capricorn-Mercury pairing is the explorer with the itemized packing list — big appetite, receipts kept. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Sagittarius All placements Aquarius → More in Capricorn ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
