      "heading": "Mercury in Gemini",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "briefly. At work it’s the natural explainer: writes the summary nobody asked for and everyone uses, onboards the new hire by accident, keeps a dying meeting alive with one more angle. Arguments are fencing, not war — this Mercury takes the other side for exercise, lands the rebuttal while your sentence is still in the air, and rarely holds the same position tomorrow. The position was for the game. The weakness is endings. Projects park at 80 percent, stories trail off before the landing, and the phone call has to be ended by the other person. Boredom arrives exactly when mastery starts charging for repetition, and this placement treats boredom as a verdict when it is usually a toll. The growth edge Depth, chosen on purpose. Knowing about things is the effortless mode here;"
