      "text": "knowing them costs the repetition this mind hates. The work is one thread finished per season — one book to the last page, one draft to done, one skill past the plateau — not to become a different thinker, but to give this one something load-bearing to stand on. The difference between interesting and useful usually lives in the last 20 percent. The two subjects this placement never got bored of are proof the depth exists; the work is picking a third on purpose. Three times a year the sky runs review season, and the mind that sends the most messages has the most to reread. The Mercury retrograde calendar lists the exact windows; this placement does some of its best editing inside them. Part of how your chart talks — the communication guide → Asked and answered What does"
