      "heading": "Mercury in Gemini",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "flattens near the end. The last stretch of anything is repetition, and repetition is this placement’s one allergy. External deadlines and a collaborator who loves endings help more than self-blame does. Who does Mercury in Gemini talk best with? Easiest with Mercuries in the other air signs, Libra and Aquarius, which match the tempo, and with Sagittarius, which matches the appetite. But conversation is trainable in a way chemistry isn’t. A full synastry comparison shows how your Mercury actually meets another chart. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Taurus All placements Cancer → More in Gemini ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
