      "text": "lands, the nickname that sticks for a decade because it was accurate and kind. The growth edge Sharing the floor as a discipline, not a favor. The room this Mercury reads so well contains quieter people holding better data, and the skill that fills silences can also learn to leave a few standing. The deeper work is separating being heard from being right — this placement would rather be quoted than correct, and the mature version notices the moments when accuracy should win the scene. Grand announcements do poorly in review season. The Mercury retrograde calendar lists the three windows a year better spent drafting than declaiming — the retold version will be stronger for the wait, and this placement knows better than anyone that the retold version is the one people keep. Part of how your chart talks — the"
