      "text": "walking back a public statement costs this placement double. The mature version learns to draft big claims privately first. Watch closely and you’ll see it correct course in action long before it says the sentence out loud. Is Mercury in Leo good for public speaking? It’s one of the natural broadcast placements: structure, timing, and a delivery that carries to the back row. The preparation style is performance-based — this Mercury knows material once it has taught it to an audience. The risk is running on charm alone, which works until the one night it doesn’t. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Cancer All placements Virgo → More in Leo ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
