      "heading": "Mercury in Libra",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Placements ☿ Mercury in Libra Classical standing neutral — no special dignity In plain English Essential dignity A traditional system for describing how supported a planet is considered in a sign. Learn more about Essential dignity → here The reply to “where should we eat?” is a shortlist of three, each with a case for and against, plus genuine curiosity about which you’d pick. Mercury in Libra thinks in comparisons — nothing is fully known until it’s known against something else. How it shows up Mercury is the chart’s thinking and phrasing; Libra tunes both for the listener. This mind learns in dialogue — an idea isn’t real until it’s been said to someone and survived the reply — and it drafts by ear, hearing how each version will land before committing to one."
