      "heading": "Mercury in Libra",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "point it’s right about to protect a process it believes in, and it remembers who fought clean long after it forgets what the fight was about. The growth edge A stated preference is not an act of war. The tact is real skill, but permanent neutrality quietly taxes everyone: the co-signers recruited for every choice, the friends who can’t find the person underneath the diplomacy. The work is small unilateral acts — order first, name the movie, say the opinion before polling the room. At 51 percent sure, choose; the relief is usually immediate, and the sky doesn’t fall. Review has its season regardless. The Mercury retrograde calendar sets aside three windows a year when revisiting a decision is officially the point — which frees this placement to spend the rest of"
