      "text": "the year making them. Part of how your chart talks — the communication guide → Asked and answered What does Mercury in Libra mean? Mercury is how you think and speak; Libra weighs both for balance and effect. People with this placement see every side by reflex, phrase things so they can land softly, and do their best thinking in dialogue. The style is fair, graceful, and slower to verdicts than to insights. Why can’t Mercury in Libra make decisions? It can — it just declines to make them unilaterally. Each option gets a fair hearing, then the hearings get appeals. The practical fix is a threshold: at 51 percent certain, choose, and don’t reopen the case without new evidence. Is Mercury in Libra passive-aggressive? It’s conflict-averse and phrasing-aware, which can"
