      "text": "shade into hint-dropping when directness feels dangerous. The native mode is diplomacy: real positions, softly upholstered. It gets direct fast with people who’ve proven they won’t treat a preference as an attack. What is Mercury in Libra good at? Editing for tone — this placement knows exactly how a sentence will land in the reader’s chest, which makes it the person who should review the hard email. It also argues both sides honestly, a rarer skill than it sounds, and mediates like it had formal training. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Virgo All placements Scorpio → More in Libra ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
