      "text": "whole, unexplained, and usually sound. The bill: forms, step four of five, the part of the plan that is only logistics. Also the agreeable nod — yes said in the room to end the pressure, then unsaid later by drift, which reads as flakiness but began as empathy. The growth edge Structure, held lightly, is a friend. The list, the calendar alarm, the two fixed anchors in a day — external scaffolding doesn’t betray this mind’s way of moving; it protects it, the way a riverbank is not an insult to the river. The other work is the honest “I don’t know yet” in place of the nod, because the nod makes promises the drift won’t keep. Review season might as well have been designed here: three windows a year on the Mercury retrograde calendar, official permission to reread, revise, and resend — the verbs this placement was already conjugating."
