      "text": "Pisces people lose their train of thought? The train has no fixed rails — this mind travels by association, so mid-sentence it sometimes catches a better connection. The thread usually comes back carrying something: the lost point returns attached to an image that says it better. A pause, rather than a prompt, gets you the good version. Which Sun signs can have Mercury in Pisces? Aquarius, Pisces, and Aries only — Mercury keeps within one sign of the Sun. An Aries Sun with Mercury in Pisces acts first and explains in metaphors afterward; an Aquarius Sun with it dreams in diagrams. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Aquarius All placements Aries → More in Pisces ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
