      "text": "literally, the best, the worst. The story is being tuned for its point, not falsified — though that difference matters more in some rooms than others. Asking “roughly or exactly?” gets you the honest version, because honesty is the one thing this placement refuses to round. How does Mercury in Sagittarius learn best? By immersion and argument: the semester abroad teaches more than the semester, and a good debate teaches more than both. It needs to see the point of a subject before it can hold the details. Give it the why first and the syllabus becomes optional. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Scorpio All placements Capricorn → More in Sagittarius ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
