      "text": "Placements ☿ Mercury in Scorpio Classical standing neutral — no special dignity In plain English Essential dignity A traditional system for describing how supported a planet is considered in a sign. Learn more about Essential dignity → here Count the questions on the drive home from dinner: this placement asked nearly all of them and answered almost none. Mercury in Scorpio runs conversation as a one-way valve — everything in, very little out, nothing out early. How it shows up Mercury is the chart’s information system; Scorpio classifies most of it. This mind learns vertically — one subject at a time, all the way to the bottom, whole evenings gone to a single thread — and it researches people the same way, quietly, before the second meeting. Subtext"
