      "text": "when nothing needs guarding, and the occasional cold read delivered as settled fact. The growth edge Sometimes the message is only the message. A mind built for subtext will find some in a grocery list, and treating every plain sentence as a cover story exhausts both parties. The work is declassification: share a thought before it hardens into a conclusion, ask the question out loud instead of running the quiet experiment, let someone watch the thinking instead of receiving the verdict. For this placement, that — an open file — is what intimacy is. Even review season runs deep here. The dates are on the Mercury retrograde calendar — three windows a year, which this Mercury uses as intended: rereading everything, saying little, revising the map. Part of"
