      "text": "how your chart talks — the communication guide → Asked and answered What does Mercury in Scorpio mean? Mercury is intake and delivery; Scorpio narrows both to what matters and guards the rest. This placement listens more than it talks, researches before it trusts, and remembers exactly what you said last time. Conversation runs as a one-way valve until you’ve earned the other direction. Why are Mercury in Scorpio people so quiet? The silence is processing, not absence. This Mercury speaks when it has a conclusion, not to keep a room comfortable, and it treats words as commitments rather than filler. When it does talk at length, that’s trust — worth noticing. How does Mercury in Scorpio argue? Rarely, precisely, and with receipts. It doesn’t raise its"
