      "text": "voice; it quotes yours back with the date attached. The unnerving part is how much was noticed and never mentioned — until it became relevant. Is Mercury in Scorpio manipulative? It’s strategic: information gets released on a schedule, and questions often have destinations. That turns into manipulation only when the other person’s map is deliberately wrong. At its best this Mercury runs an honest interrogation both parties agreed to — most good therapists and editors have some version of it. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Libra All placements Sagittarius → More in Scorpio ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
