      "text": "Placements ☿ Mercury in Taurus Classical standing neutral — no special dignity In plain English Essential dignity A traditional system for describing how supported a planet is considered in a sign. Learn more about Essential dignity → here Nothing here gets said before it is sure. Mercury in Taurus thinks the way bread rises — slowly, at its own temperature, ruined by anyone who keeps checking on it. The pause before it answers isn’t hesitation; it’s manufacturing. How it shows up Mercury handles intake, sorting, and delivery; Taurus sets all three to simmer. This mind learns through the hands and through repetition — do the thing, do it again, own it permanently. What it keeps, it keeps for decades: recipes, lyrics, the exact phrase the mechanic used about the noise in 2014. The vocabulary runs to concrete nouns, and directions come as landmarks — past the bakery, over the"
