      "heading": "Mercury in Taurus",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "better posture. Is Mercury in Taurus stubborn? Its opinions form slowly, out of direct experience, and once set they resist renovation. That’s a real cost in fast-moving arguments and a real asset everywhere else — this is the estimate you can build on. The fix isn’t thinking faster; it’s scheduling the occasional re-check of a settled view. Which Sun signs can have Mercury in Taurus? Aries, Taurus, or Gemini Suns only. Mercury never sits more than one sign from the Sun, so your options are always your Sun sign and its two neighbors. An Aries Sun with Mercury in Taurus moves fast and speaks slow, which surprises people twice. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Aries All placements Gemini → More in Taurus ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
