      "title": "Mercury in Virgo: precision as a first language",
      "heading": "Mercury in Virgo",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "a Leo. Can my Mercury be in Virgo? Yes, and it’s common. Mercury never travels more than one sign from the Sun, so Leo Suns carry Mercury in Cancer, Leo, or Virgo. Leo Sun with Virgo Mercury is the performer with the flawless setlist — big presence, checked footnotes. Why does Mercury in Virgo criticize so much? Read it as a dialect: this placement edits what it cares about and ignores what it doesn’t. The comma it flags means it read every word you wrote. That said, the translation shouldn’t always be the listener’s job — saying the care in plain words is part of the placement’s growth. Is this your Mercury? Mercury’s review seasons are computed to the hour, through 2027. See the retrograde calendar ↗ Mercury through the signs ← Leo All placements Libra → More in Virgo ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
