      "title": "Moon in Capricorn: competence as comfort",
      "heading": "Moon in Capricorn",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "at standard temperature, being processed elsewhere on its own schedule. People who stay long enough to see the process — or who are finally allowed to — usually revise the first impression completely. Do I need my birth time to know my Moon sign? In just over half of birthdays, the date is enough on its own. The Moon changes sign every two and a half days or so, which puts the remaining birthdays on a boundary where the hour decides. The Moon sign calculator states plainly when yours is one of them. Is this your Moon? Not sure this is your Moon? The calculator reads it from your birth date — and says honestly when the day is ambiguous. Find your moon sign ↗ Moon through the signs ← Sagittarius All placements Aquarius → More in Capricorn ☉ Sun ☿ Mercury ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
