      "text": "the light, but the person who is one. If the placement is hearsay so far, the Moon sign calculator confirms it from your birth date — and tells you when a birthday sits close enough to a sign change to need the clock. Asked and answered What does Moon in Leo mean? The Moon describes what refuels you, and in Leo the fuel is warm, specific attention from people who matter. Feelings get expressed at their true size — joy loudly, hurt visibly, love generously. This Moon doesn’t need a crowd; it needs to be unmistakably valued by its chosen few. Are Leo Moons dramatic? They’re scaled honestly — the expression matches the feeling, which quieter placements find loud. The performance isn’t insincerity; for this Moon, showing a feeling well is part of respecting it. The sulk, when it comes, is a signal of feeling invisible, not a bid for worship. What does a Leo Moon need in a"
