      "path": "/learn/placements/neptune-in-aries/",
      "title": "Neptune in Aries: the dream of beginning",
      "heading": "Neptune in Aries",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "mostly infants — the cohort is being born. For everyone older, Neptune in Aries is a transit: it colors the years for all of us, and it only turns personal where it aspects planets in your own chart. Is Neptune in Aries good or bad? Neither — it describes a flavor of collective imagination, not a grade. The gift side is idealism with nerve, a generation that believes in acting. The fog side is mistaking agitation for direction. What one person builds from that depends on the rest of the chart. Is this your Neptune? The house does the individual work for a generational planet — see yours. Get your free birth chart ↗ Neptune through the signs ← Pisces All placements Taurus → More in Aries ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ☿ Mercury ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♇ Pluto"
