      "title": "Neptune in Virgo: the dream of useful hands",
      "heading": "Neptune in Virgo",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "September 1928, with a final pass ending in August 1943. Is Neptune weak in Virgo? Neptune carries no classical dignities anywhere — it was discovered long after those tables were drawn — so Virgo is not its detriment in any traditional sense. The tension people sense is temperamental: the planet of soft focus in the sign of fine print. The chart around it decides how that resolves. Who has Neptune in Virgo? Where it survives in living charts, it belongs to a family’s eldest generation; mostly it is now a placement for historical and ancestral work. The next cohort begins arriving in 2092. Is this your Neptune? The house does the individual work for a generational planet — see yours. Get your free birth chart ↗ Neptune through the signs ← Leo All placements Libra → More in Virgo ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ☿ Mercury ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♇ Pluto"
