      "path": "/learn/placements/pluto-in-capricorn/",
      "title": "Pluto in Capricorn: rebuilding authority",
      "heading": "Pluto in Capricorn",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "from 2008 through late 2024. The oldest of them turned eighteen in 2026, which makes this the Pluto generation currently arriving at adulthood. Is Pluto in Capricorn a difficult placement? It’s a shared one, which removes most of the personal weight. The cohort’s common inheritance is skepticism toward institutions it has only seen under strain — and skepticism can mature into better building or harden into blanket distrust. Which way it goes in one life shows up in the house and aspects, not the sign. Is this your Pluto? The house does the individual work for a generational planet — see yours. Get your free birth chart ↗ Pluto through the signs ← Sagittarius All placements Aquarius → More in Capricorn ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ☿ Mercury ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♅ Uranus ♆ Neptune"
