      "path": "/learn/placements/uranus-in-aries/",
      "title": "Uranus in Aries: the reflex to begin again",
      "heading": "Uranus in Aries",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "call this pairing loud, since planet and sign both favor speed and independence, but how it actually behaves depends on the house it occupies and the aspects it makes. How do I read Uranus in Aries personally? Start with the house, which only a birth time can place — everyone born in the era shares the sign, so the house is where the placement stops being demographic. Then check aspects to your inner planets; a tight contact from Uranus to your Sun or Moon says far more than the sign alone. Is this your Uranus? The house does the individual work for a generational planet — see yours. Get your free birth chart ↗ Uranus through the signs ← Pisces All placements Taurus → More in Aries ☉ Sun ☽ Moon ☿ Mercury ♀ Venus ♂ Mars ♃ Jupiter ♄ Saturn ♆ Neptune ♇ Pluto"
