      "path": "/rising-sign/aries/",
      "title": "Aries Rising: first through every door",
      "heading": "Aries rising",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "page shows where Mars is right now; your birth chart shows where yours is. How is Aries rising different from an Aries sun? The sun is what you are; the rising is how you arrive. An Aries sun runs on Aries fuel all the way down. Aries rising can sit on top of any sun at all — a Pisces sun with Aries rising reads as bold on approach and tender underneath, which surprises people in both directions. Do I need my exact birth time to know my rising sign? Yes — the ascendant changes sign about every two hours, so even 'morning' versus 'afternoon' can move it. The calculator on this page needs date, time, and place; if the time is approximate, try the window's edges and see which description actually fits. Keep reading The Aries guide Sun, moon, rising Your birth chart Other risings ← Pisces Gemini Cancer Leo Virgo Libra Scorpio Sagittarius Capricorn Aquarius Taurus →"
