      "title": "Capricorn Rising: older than the room",
      "heading": "Capricorn rising",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Rising signs Capricorn rising Chart ruler Saturn — the planet that steers this chart Element · Modality earth · cardinal The turnover the ascendant changes sign about every two hours — twelve risings every day Some first impressions are weather. Capricorn rising is architecture — you arrive load-bearing, and rooms quietly rearrange themselves on the assumption that you’ll hold. The manner The ascendant is the sign coming up in the east at your first breath, and it decides the opening frame: pace, posture, what your face defaults to between expressions. Capricorn rising reads as composed . You move deliberately, waste few words, and deliver your best jokes deadpan, without breaking stride. Cardinal earth starts things and expects them to still be standing later — and the manner announces that intention before you’ve said"
