      "path": "/rising-sign/capricorn/",
      "title": "Capricorn Rising: older than the room",
      "heading": "Capricorn rising",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "lists, drafts, the sentence that finally holds. And because Saturn runs the chart, the Saturn return around age twenty-nine lands with extra weight for this rising: less a stranger’s visit than a review from the planet you’ve been reporting to all along. Find your Saturn in your birth chart and start reading there. The ascendant also sets the wheel: Capricorn rising puts Aquarius on your second house, Pisces on your third, and so on around — the reason two people with the same sun sign can keep their lives in entirely different drawers. Rising versus sun The sun sign is the engine; the rising is the front office. When they match, people meet you accurately on the first pass. When they differ, the rising wins the interview and the sun wins the decade — a Leo sun behind Capricorn rising presents in gray flannel and turns out to"
