      "text": "powers the life; the rising is how the life walks in. A Capricorn sun is ambitious at the core whatever it wears on approach. Capricorn rising can front any sun at all — a Leo sun behind it presents as all business, then turns out to be running the meeting for the love of the room. Do Capricorn risings really age in reverse? It's the tradition's favorite observation about this ascendant, and it holds up surprisingly often. Capricorn risings tend to read older than their age early — serious children, dependable teenagers — then loosen decade by decade as the composure gets comfortable. The gravity never leaves; it just stops being a uniform and starts being a choice. Keep reading The Capricorn guide Sun, moon, rising Your birth chart Other risings ← Sagittarius Aries Taurus Gemini Cancer Leo Virgo Libra Scorpio Pisces Aquarius →"
