      "text": "Compatibility Aries and Capricorn Aries and Capricorn in love and the long run: this weekend versus the ten-year plan, the tempo and respect fights, and what these two builders can make. Both of these partners intend to win; the argument is about the clock. Aries wants it by Friday. Capricorn has it scheduled for 2031 and considers that aggressive. What looks from outside like a mismatch is closer to a complete engine — once the two of them stop grading each other’s tempo. How this pairing runs Aries supplies ignition; Capricorn supplies the finish. One produces starts on demand — the idea, the nerve, the first irreversible step — and the other does its best work in the unglamorous middle where the applause stops, and ships what it starts. Each is a master of the exact phase the other can’t stand. The early"
