      "text": "Compatibility Aries and Libra Aries and Libra in love and the long run: the self-directed meets the other-directed, the verdict and peacekeeping fights, and why these opposites hold. Aries knew by the second date. Libra is still happily weighing it, with a strong case filed for each outcome. That gap is the engine of this famous match: the person who runs on their own verdict, drawn hard to the one who can hear everybody’s. How this pairing runs Aries states a preference the instant it forms. Libra sees the other side of every question at full resolution — including the case against its own lunch order — and treats choosing like closing a door on a persuasive friend. So the roles assign themselves early: Aries supplies the verdicts, Libra supplies the diplomacy, and between them a decision"
