      "text": "Compatibility Aries and Sagittarius Aries and Sagittarius in love and the long run: two honest, restless partners on the move, the follow-through fights, and how the adventure keeps its shape. Ask how this couple is doing and they’ll answer from an airport. Aries and Sagittarius agree on the important things immediately: forward is the direction, honesty is the policy, and nobody restricts anybody — that last one less a compromise than the founding treaty. How this pairing runs Both are fast, but the vectors differ enough to stay interesting. Aries wants to be first — the front of the race, the opening move, the win. Sagittarius wants to be farther — the next country, the bigger question, more map. Point those in the same general direction and you get a couple who hear each other’s wildest plans as invitations, where every previous"
