      "path": "/compatibility/cancer-pisces/",
      "title": "Cancer and Pisces compatibility",
      "heading": "Cancer and Pisces",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "which for Cancer is an almost disorienting mercy. Friends notice the shorthand first: one look across a crowded table and a plan changes, no words exchanged. What structure exists comes mostly from Cancer, who at least maintains a calendar of other people’s birthdays. Pisces contributes imagination, tenderness, and a serene indifference to whose turn it was to plan anything. In love Devotion in soft focus, from both sides. Cancer builds the home around you; Pisces paints you a shade more generously than the facts support and sincerely means the portrait. Both are romantics of the complete surrender school, and neither will ever call the other too sensitive — the accusation both have fielded all their lives is simply not available in this house. That alone makes the relationship a refuge. Anniversaries here are less"
