      "path": "/compatibility/cancer-pisces/",
      "title": "Cancer and Pisces compatibility",
      "heading": "Cancer and Pisces",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "reflects it back; Cancer reads the reflected gloom as something it caused and sinks further; within a day the house is carrying one large feeling that started nowhere and belongs to nobody. The eventual argument — months late, strangely gentle — is about who was supposed to say something. Neither was. That’s the fight. What makes it last A spine, installed on purpose. The tenderness needs no work at all; what needs building is machinery for decisions and honesty, because neither partner will supply it by instinct. Give every domain one owner — Cancer takes the calendar and the logistics it half-runs anyway; Pisces takes the questions worth answering slowly, like where to wander in October. Then a standing hour of plain words each week: one true sentence apiece about how things actually are, hurt included, hints"
