      "text": "Compatibility Capricorn and Aquarius Capricorn and Aquarius compatibility: the builder and the questioner. What two stubborn, composed minds respect in each other, and what makes it last. Put a rule in front of these two and you’ll learn everything about the pairing. Capricorn asks whether it works; Aquarius asks whether it should exist. They are the zodiac’s two great skeptics — one of shortcuts, one of customs — and the relationship runs on a respect neither expected to feel on meeting. How this pairing runs More alike than either reputation admits. Both are composed under pressure, immune to peer panic, and stubborn on a geological schedule: positions built slowly and held for decades. The difference is what each conserves. Capricorn keeps whatever has proven it works; Aquarius keeps whatever principle has survived its own questioning."
