      "text": "Compatibility Gemini and Leo Gemini and Leo compatibility: wit meets warmth. How these two run a room together, the teasing fight they keep replaying, and what keeps it going. Watch these two at a party: Leo holds the room, and Gemini keeps handing it better material. The pairing runs on a natural division of showmanship — warmth plus wit, occasion plus commentary — and at its best it feels less like dating and more like a double act that happens to be in love. How this pairing runs Gemini supplies motion: the ideas, the invitations, the interesting stranger brought home for dinner. Leo supplies gravity, taking the best of Gemini’s scattered enthusiasms and turning them into occasions — with candles, on the calendar, attended. Leo holds a course for decades once it’s chosen; Gemini orbits, samples, and"
