      "path": "/compatibility/gemini-libra/",
      "title": "Gemini and Libra compatibility",
      "heading": "Gemini and Libra",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "while it’s still small enough to say lightly, which is the register both are best at anyway. What they’re protecting is worth the procedure: a shared life that is genuinely pleasant, easy in a way most couples never manage. Pleasant has a bad reputation among people who’ve never had it. These two, run honestly, get to keep it for decades. Why this pairing reads this way Elements, modes, polarity, and each sign’s basic pattern Gemini May 21 – Jun 20 Air · Mutable · Mercury Libra Sep 23 – Oct 22 Air · Cardinal · Venus Elements Crosswind Endless conversation and mutual independence. Feelings need an appointment, made on purpose, kept. Modes Starter and adapter One sets the direction, the other adjusts course without ego. Low friction — watch that drift doesn’t replace steering. Polarity Both day signs: energy runs outward on"
