      "path": "/compatibility/gemini-pisces/",
      "title": "Gemini and Pisces compatibility",
      "heading": "Gemini and Pisces",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "a void. Gemini learns that some feelings finish on their own schedule. Pisces learns that a rough draft, offered early, spares them both the theories. The exchange underneath holds the rest: Gemini gets a life with more in it than can be said. Pisces gets someone who can say it anyway. Why this pairing reads this way Elements, modes, polarity, and each sign’s basic pattern Gemini May 21 – Jun 20 Air · Mutable · Mercury Pisces Feb 19 – Mar 20 Water · Mutable · Neptune Elements Naming the weather Air wants the feeling named; water wants it felt. The translation work never fully ends, and it’s worth doing. Modes Two sails Endlessly adaptable and rarely in open conflict. Decisions can orbit for months without landing; name a deadline. Polarity One day sign, one night sign: one thinks out loud, the other thinks first."
