      "title": "Gemini and Sagittarius compatibility",
      "heading": "Gemini and Sagittarius",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "language; it just stops being the escape hatch. The reward for staying is the discovery both were built to make: going deep is also travel. The hundredth hour of each other outruns the first hour of anywhere, and these are the two people best equipped to verify that claim — repeatedly, out loud, from the road. Why this pairing reads this way Elements, modes, polarity, and each sign’s basic pattern Gemini May 21 – Jun 20 Air · Mutable · Mercury Sagittarius Nov 22 – Dec 21 Fire · Mutable · Jupiter Elements Oxygen Air feeds fire and fire keeps air warm — quick, talkative, and mobile. Somebody still has to anchor the calendar. Modes Two sails Endlessly adaptable and rarely in open conflict. Decisions can orbit for months without landing; name a deadline. Polarity Both day signs: energy runs outward on both sides, toward"
