      "text": "Compatibility Gemini and Virgo Gemini and Virgo compatibility: one collects, one corrects. What two sharp minds build together, where the accuracy fights start, and what makes it last. These two run on the same quick, verbal wiring and put it to opposite work. Gemini gathers — facts, people, tabs, enthusiasms; Virgo refines, sorting the useful from the merely interesting and improving whatever survives. Together they’re either the best editorial partnership either has known, or a standing argument about accuracy. Usually both. How this pairing runs Conversation is the shared country. Both notice everything, both think in sentences, and neither has ever run out of material; dinner goes long in this house. Underneath the talk, the division of labor is clean: Gemini finds it, Virgo makes it work. Gemini arrives with nine"
