      "text": "ideas; Virgo can tell which two are real, and quietly upgrades them. It’s the rare pairing in which both partners feel sharper inside the relationship than out of it. Each also supplies the audience the other has been missing. Virgo’s invisible fixes — the refilled prescription, the rebooked flight — finally get noticed, because noticing is Gemini’s whole profession. And Gemini’s range finally gets an editor, which is the difference between ten open projects and two finished ones. In love Virgo flirts by paying attention: it has thought about your life in detail, and the proof arrives as help, exactly where needed, before being asked. Gemini flirts by asking — real questions, follow-ups, your answers retrievable a year later. These are two of the most underrated love languages going, and each partner happens to be"
