      "text": "fluent in the other’s. Gemini falls for how deep Virgo goes on subjects Gemini only skimmed. Virgo falls for laughing this much — and for a partner who reads the noticing as devotion rather than criticism. Most days, that’s exactly what it is. The pace difference matters less than outsiders predict: Virgo decides slowly and means it, Gemini decides quickly and revises, and both usually land in the same place — twice. Where it grinds The correction. Gemini tells stories for effect — numbers rounded, timeline compressed, the dull middle deleted — and Virgo repairs the facts mid-anecdote, at the table, in front of guests. To Virgo this is maintenance, barely worth mentioning. To Gemini it’s a heckle from inside the marriage. Nobody remembers the story afterward; everybody remembers the edit. The same fight runs the other"
