      "heading": "Leo and Pisces",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Compatibility Leo and Pisces Leo and Pisces in love, friendship, and the long run: the performer and the believer, where volume meets drift, and what makes it last. Every performer dreams of an audience like Pisces — attentive, generous, moved at all the right moments, and entirely sincere. And Leo may be the steadiest light Pisces has ever had to steer by: warm, legible, loyal on the record. What begins as mutual relief then has to learn to survive the volume difference. How this pairing runs Leo broadcasts; Pisces receives — everything, including transmissions Leo didn’t know it was sending. Pisces registers the mood of the day before Leo’s coat is off, adapts around it, helps without being asked, and never mentions it afterward. Leo, in return, is a fixed point in the Pisces tides: feelings announced"
