      "title": "Leo and Pisces compatibility",
      "heading": "Leo and Pisces",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "rather than hinted, loyalty declared by name, a partner who is exactly where they said they’d be, shining at the stated brightness. For a person with porous edges, that legibility is a kind of rest. Nothing has to be decoded. And Leo, for once, doesn’t have to campaign to be understood; Pisces got there before the introductions ended. In love The romance runs deep and slightly idealized in both directions, and both prefer it that way. Pisces sees Leo at its best and paints accordingly; Leo, seen that generously, does something surprising — it starts living up to the portrait. Leo stages the romance; Pisces believes in it completely, which for a performer is the entire dream. The protective streak locks in early, too: Pisces absorbs every room’s bruises on the way through life, and it has never had a"
