      "text": "Compatibility Leo and Virgo Leo and Virgo in love, friendship, and the long run: what works between the performer and the editor, where the noticing grinds, and what makes it last. Virgo notices everything. Leo needs to be noticed. On paper that’s a perfect trade, and on many days it actually is — one partner supplying the exact attention the other runs on. The complication is that Virgo’s attention comes with margin notes, and Leo has never once asked for notes. How this pairing runs Leo supplies the show; Virgo runs the production. Leo announces the dinner party; Virgo has already noticed that the oven runs hot and that one guest can’t eat shellfish. The division of labor is natural and mostly happy: Leo’s plans are grand and structurally optimistic, Virgo can’t watch anything run at eighty"
