      "text": "percent without quietly drafting version two, and under that care Leo’s productions genuinely improve — better, smoother, on time. In return, Virgo’s competence finally gets an audience, since Virgo would sooner move to another city than promote itself. The early misread runs both directions: Leo takes Virgo’s reserve for coolness, Virgo takes Leo’s shine for a lack of substance. Both are wrong, and they tend to find out in the same week. In love Virgo flirts by paying attention — the prescription refilled, the dreaded deadline remembered — and Leo, whose deepest wish is to be attended to, finds this quietly intoxicating. A Virgo who has started fixing things in your life has already made a decision about you; Leo just has to learn to read the decision, because it will not be announced from a"
