      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Compatibility Libra and Aquarius Libra and Aquarius in love, friendship, and the long run: the long conversation, where warmth meets distance, and what makes this pairing last. This one begins as a conversation and, in the good versions, never stops being one. Libra and Aquarius recognize each other quickly: two people who lead with ideas, keep their composure, and would rather understand an argument than win it. How this pairing runs Lightly, by most couples’ standards. The talk is the engine — politics, people, the design of everything — with Libra presenting both sides of every question and Aquarius contributing a third side nobody had considered. Neither crowds the other: Libra’s attentiveness never turns into surveillance, and Aquarius’s independence never demands an audience. Jealousy, standard equipment in so many"
