      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Compatibility Libra and Capricorn Libra and Capricorn in love, friendship, and the long run: the host and the builder, where tempo and priorities grind, and what makes this pairing last. Libra keeps a calendar of people; Capricorn keeps a calendar of goals. Both take commitment more seriously than nearly anyone else on the wheel — this match is two serious people discovering, somewhere in the middle of a life, that they are serious about different sections of it. How this pairing runs Capricorn builds the structure: the career, the house, the ten-year plan that quietly includes you. Libra furnishes it with people: the friendships kept warm, the two families translated to each other, the social world that makes a structure worth living in. In public they are formidable — Capricorn’s quiet authority plus Libra’s fluency opens most rooms,"
