      "locale": "en",
      "text": "and neither ever embarrasses the other, which both privately rank higher than passion. Trust arrives fast, because both keep their word. A Capricorn promise made three years ago is still in force; a Libra weighs fairness honestly even when the verdict costs it. Each recognizes the reliability early and relaxes into it, which for two careful signs is saying something. In love Both court deliberately. Capricorn verifies its feelings twice before announcing them; Libra weighs, and weighs, and then commits with real ceremony. Neither treats the beginning casually, so the beginning, though slow, can be believed. Once inside, the love arrives on different channels. Capricorn loves structurally — the crisis handled, the future designed, the car serviced without comment. Libra loves attentively — the anniversary composed, the preference"
