      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Compatibility Libra and Pisces Libra and Pisces in love, friendship, and the long run: two gentle accommodators, romance in abundance, the fight neither starts, and what makes it last. On paper this is the gentlest pairing on the wheel: nobody yells, nobody dominates, nobody grabs the remote. Libra bends to keep things fair; Pisces flows to keep things kind. The gentleness is completely real. So is what it quietly makes room for. How this pairing runs Atmospherically. Libra arranges — the room, the plans, the social surface — and Pisces attunes, reading the emotional weather before anyone has spoken. Together they make the softest landing in the zodiac: friends bring their crises to this couch and leave soothed by one partner and understood by the other, often without being able to say which was which. The operating flaw"
