      "text": "Compatibility Libra and Scorpio Libra and Scorpio in love, friendship, and the long run: charm meets depth, why smooth surfaces get questioned, and what makes this pairing last. Scorpio has never trusted a smooth surface in its life, and Libra produces the smoothest surfaces on the wheel. That is the whole engagement, right there: one partner keeping the water calm, the other watching it for movement — each fascinated by the other for exactly the reasons they will eventually fight. How this pairing runs Libra runs the couple’s daylight: the friendships, the hosting, the graceful public face that makes everyone assume things are effortless. Scorpio runs the depths: the real conversation after the guests leave, the loyalty, the 3 a.m. crisis Libra never has to face alone. Divided that way, the arrangement is"
