      "text": "Compatibility Sagittarius and Capricorn Sagittarius and Capricorn in love: the leap and the ladder, why risk is the fight they keep having, and what makes this odd couple genuinely last. Neighbors on the wheel, keeping different clocks. Sagittarius treats the future as something big that rewards boldness; Capricorn treats it as something long that rewards patience. Between the leap and the ladder there is more romance than either expects — and one argument they will be having, in some form, for the rest of their lives. How this pairing runs Sagittarius announces; Capricorn verifies. A plan enters the house at dinner — the move, the pivot, the idea that has to happen — and meets a partner who asks, without changing expression, what year two looks like. It sounds like friction and is actually the machine"
