      "text": "Compatibility Sagittarius and Pisces Sagittarius and Pisces in love: two believers with different escape routes, the bluntness versus tenderness fight, and what makes this match last. Both of these signs live partly elsewhere — Sagittarius out on the map, Pisces deep in the inner world — and both run on an unreasonable, load-bearing faith that things will work out. The shared bigness is real chemistry. The test is what happens when life gets sharp and each partner reaches for a favorite exit. How this pairing runs Yes is the house default. Plans balloon happily: Sagittarius proposes the trip, and Pisces — the rare partner who hears a big plan as an invitation rather than a threat — is already imagining it in color. One supplies motion, the other meaning. Sagittarius comes home with stories;"
