      "text": "Compatibility Scorpio and Pisces Scorpio and Pisces in love, friendship, and the long run: two fluent readers of feeling, where definition meets drift, and what makes it last. Nobody has to explain anything. Scorpio reads motives; Pisces reads moods; between the two of them, everything unsaid in a room is fully covered before the coats come off. Most couples spend years building that kind of shorthand. These two walk in with it. How this pairing runs Fluency from the first evening. Pisces knows the mood before a word lands; Scorpio has usually worked out the cause. Depth is the shared native country — neither flinches at the unlit parts of a person, and neither wants the small-talk version of anything. What changes everything for Scorpio is that Pisces doesn’t audit. No tests, no scorekeeping, no angles — mercy first,"
