      "locale": "en",
      "text": "They even share a definition of a good night: one other person, the real conversation, and no performance for anybody. Where it grinds Definition versus drift. Scorpio wants the truth in solid form — what happened, what you want, where you stand — and Pisces often doesn’t have positions in that shape. It has tides, and the honest answer changes with them. Pressed, Pisces goes vague, agrees in order to end the pressing, then drifts from the agreement it never really made. Scorpio smells the gap between word and deed — concealment, the one unforgivable — and escalates to full investigation. Pisces, feeling prosecuted, dissolves further out of reach. The misery of this loop is that nobody is lying, and both feel deceived. The second grind is absorption. Pisces takes on Scorpio’s pressurized moods and ends up carrying"
