      "heading": "Taurus and Gemini",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Compatibility Taurus and Gemini Taurus and Gemini in love, friendship, and the long run: what works between the keeper and the collector, where this pairing grinds, and what makes it last. Give Taurus a free evening and it deepens: the proven recipe, the favorite chair, the friend of fifteen years. Give Gemini the same evening and it multiplies — two plans, three conversations, one brand-new interest by ten o’clock. That’s the whole pairing in miniature: one of them gathers, the other keeps, and each is quietly amazed the other’s method works. How this pairing runs Gemini brings the news. New people, new facts, the plaque under the statue, what the barista said — the world arrives at this household daily, curated and narrated. Taurus turns out to be the audience Gemini never knew it was missing: actually"
