      "text": "the attention — Gemini asks real questions and remembers the answers — and stays for the entertainment, which never runs out. The Bull should know what the crown jewels are here: being the first person Gemini texts a discovery to is that sign’s version of the cooked meal. Receive it accordingly, and answer. Long drives are where this pairing does its best work: one narrating the world going by, one steering, both exactly where they want to be. Where it grinds The dissolving plan. Gemini pivots when better information arrives — a different restaurant, a moved weekend, a later train — and calls it flexibility. Taurus experiences each pivot as a small breach of contract, because to the Bull a plan is a promise with a date on it. Enough pivots and Taurus quietly stops trusting the calendar, and a Taurus that has"
