      "path": "/compatibility/taurus-virgo/",
      "title": "Taurus and Virgo compatibility",
      "heading": "Taurus and Virgo",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "never clocks out — one unhurried evening quiets Virgo’s inner editor better than any argument with it ever has. And Virgo, who takes care of everyone and accepts care awkwardly, finally sits down to someone else’s cooking and lets it happen. Thirty years on, the recipe still holds. So do they. Why this pairing reads this way Elements, modes, polarity, and each sign’s basic pattern Taurus Apr 20 – May 20 Earth · Fixed · Venus Virgo Aug 23 – Sep 22 Earth · Mutable · Mercury Elements Bedrock Two earth signs build a life that works on paper and in practice. Booking the surprises becomes a shared chore. Modes Anchor and sail Stability plus flexibility, each supplying what the other skips — resented only when either denies the other’s function. Polarity Both night signs: both process inward before anything shows."
