      "heading": "Virgo and Capricorn",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "left to fix. This is the couple others call when the ceiling falls in, the one whose word is still good on promises made years ago, the one that finally learned — together, late, gladly — that the view was allowed to be enjoyed before the summit. The structure holds, and it’s warm inside. Why this pairing reads this way Elements, modes, polarity, and each sign’s basic pattern Virgo Aug 23 – Sep 22 Earth · Mutable · Mercury Capricorn Dec 22 – Jan 19 Earth · Cardinal · Saturn Elements Bedrock Two earth signs build a life that works on paper and in practice. Booking the surprises becomes a shared chore. Modes Starter and adapter One sets the direction, the other adjusts course without ego. Low friction — watch that drift doesn’t replace steering. Polarity Both night signs: both process inward before anything shows."
