      "heading": "Virgo and Virgo",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Compatibility Virgo and Virgo Virgo and Virgo in love, friendship, and the long run: two fixers, one shared standard, where the double inner critic grinds, and what makes it last. Two Virgos together get the rarest thing either will ever find: a partner who notices back. Everything that makes Virgo an acquired taste — the standards, the running commentary, the compulsive fixing — is suddenly mutual, legible, and appreciated. The catch is that everything doubles, including the parts neither of them can see. How this pairing runs Smoothly — sometimes suspiciously so. Two people who both keep lists, both arrive early, and both refill the prescription without being asked produce a household that runs like a well-kept instrument. Chores don’t stack. Appointments don’t slip. Each finally lives with someone who understands that “I"
