      "text": "the sign’s teacher-explorer — first up the hill, then back down for the stragglers. Ask its friends: nobody leaves this person’s company without a recommendation to follow up on. Fire that hands you a map The third-decan Aries Sun pairs Mars confidence with Jupiter’s instinct for meaning, and the blend naturally mentors. April 14 people collect younger colleagues, coach rec leagues, explain their craft to anyone who asks and several who didn’t. The generosity is real — knowledge here is for spending, not hoarding — and so is the enjoyment of the podium. At its best this date raises everyone’s ceiling; even its bragging tends to be instructional. Watch one explain something twice — the second pass is always better, because"
