      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Birthdays Born on April 21 April 21 is the first date fully inside Taurus — opening degrees, Venus-ruled first decan. What day-one earth means for character, love, and work. Sun sign Taurus Steady hands, good taste, and a long memory for comfort. Exact date & cusp check Sun degrees, decan, and this year’s sky Sun sign Taurus — every year, 1940–2030 Sun degrees 0°30′ Taurus – 1°54′ Taurus · noon UTC, 1940–2030 Decan first decan of Taurus — traditional ruler Venus This year April 21, 2026: Sun 1°23′ Taurus · Moon in Gemini at noon UTC The zodiac’s most patient sign starts its year here. April 21 is the first date wholly inside Taurus — opening degrees, Venus-ruled first decan, the boundary a safe day behind. Where last week’s birthdays carry leftover sparks,"
