      "heading": "Born on April 21",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "roots — no stage skipped, none rushed. What April 21 offers a partner is presence without performance; what it asks is consistency, since wobble reads as warning. At work this date lays foundations — the colleague whose estimates hold, whose midweek output matches Monday’s promise, whose calm makes deadlines feel less like cliffs. Trades, crafts, kitchens, gardens, care: anywhere quality accumulates, this birthday thrives. Digging in before surveying The friction of young fixity: April 21 can plant its feet on the first patch of ground it likes, before checking whether the ground deserves it — the adequate job kept a decade, the good-enough arrangement never renegotiated. The growth edge is separating steadiness from settlement. Stay slow, but survey first;"
