      "locale": "en",
      "text": "roots do their best work in chosen soil, and a season of looking costs less than a decade of settling. Everything above is Sun-sign weather. The climate — where the stubbornness builds, what it protects, how it greets strangers — is chart-wide, and the birth chart maps it from your exact hour and town. The date, answered What zodiac sign is April 21? Taurus. In every year from 1940 through 2030, the Sun is in Taurus on April 21 — between 0°30′ Taurus and 1°54′ Taurus at noon universal time. Is April 21 on the cusp? It sits close to the previous sign's boundary — about 0.5° at the nearest — but it stays on the Taurus side in every year from 1940 to 2030. Your sun sign is Taurus regardless of birth year. What decan is April 21? The first decan of Taurus"
