      "text": "Whatever the Bull means, this stretch means it twice. The senses in charge A double-Venus Taurus Sun runs its life through the body’s instruments. April 22 registers rooms as textures and temperatures, judges days by meals, and trusts a gut verdict over a spreadsheet with a clear conscience — the gut has the better record. Taste is the organizing talent: for objects, for food, for people. This date simply knows what’s good, early and without argument, and builds its world from the shortlist. Ask for a restaurant, a mattress, or an honest opinion of your haircut — the answers arrive with the same calm authority. Affection you can hold Love, for April 22, is administered physically and materially — cooked, carried, fixed, kept warm. Grand speeches are suspect;"
