      "text": "Birthdays Born on August 18 Born on August 18: the Sun near 25–26° Leo, deep in the Mars-ruled decan. Concentrated will, all-in loyalty, and the listening gap worth minding. Sun sign Leo Warm-hearted, expressive, born for the spotlight. Exact date & cusp check Sun degrees, decan, and this year’s sky Sun sign Leo — every year, 1940–2030 Sun degrees 24°40′ Leo – 26°04′ Leo · noon UTC, 1940–2030 Decan third decan of Leo — traditional ruler Mars This year August 18, 2026: Sun 25°34′ Leo · Moon in Scorpio at noon UTC Past the sign’s midpoint, Leo stops asking for the room’s attention and starts assuming it. August 18 sits well into the Mars-ruled third decan of Leo , where the sign’s fire burns narrower and hotter — fewer projects, deeper"
