      "title": "August 4 zodiac: Leo — the patron's birthday",
      "heading": "Born on August 4",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "where credit pools upward and never comes back down. Enough is a skill The friction is that giving can quietly become steering. A benefactor’s opinion about how the gift gets used tends to arrive attached, and recipients start feeling managed rather than backed. There’s a budget question too — this decan gives past its means and calls it optimism. Learning where enough sits, in money and in involvement, is the honest work of the date. One placement, however vivid, is not a chart. Your Moon, rising sign, and houses come from the birth time and place, and they decide where this patron’s fire spends itself. The birth chart calculator works it out from the exact moment. The date, answered What zodiac sign is August 4? Leo. In every year from 1940 through 2030, the Sun is in Leo on August 4 — between 11°13′ Leo and 12°37′ Leo at noon universal time. Is August 4 on the cusp?"
