      "text": "Birthdays Born on August 7 August 7 puts the Sun at the center of Leo, deep in the Jupiter-ruled decan. Loud loyalty, chosen people, and the scorekeeping habit worth watching. Sun sign Leo Warm-hearted, expressive, born for the spotlight. Exact date & cusp check Sun degrees, decan, and this year’s sky Sun sign Leo — every year, 1940–2030 Sun degrees 14°06′ Leo – 15°30′ Leo · noon UTC, 1940–2030 Decan second decan of Leo — traditional ruler Jupiter This year August 7, 2026: Sun 15°00′ Leo · Moon in Gemini at noon UTC Dead center of Leo — that’s the Sun’s position on August 7, about as far from either border of the sign as a birthday can get. Mid-sign dates carry the archetype at full concentration, and this one draws it through the Jupiter-ruled second decan: Leo loyalty, sized extra large. Loyalty with volume Plenty of signs are loyal; the Leo Sun is loyal audibly. An August 7"
