      "text": "reorgs. It needs, in return, some sign that the loyalty registered — an annual review means less to this date than a named thank-you in front of the team. The scorekeeping trap The friction is the invisible ledger. All that given loyalty accrues, quietly, as expectation — and when reciprocity falls short, hurt arrives with interest and a full accounting. Nobody else agreed to the terms, which is the problem. The growth edge is giving what’s freely given and invoicing nothing — or else asking plainly instead of tallying silently. Two people born on this same date, hours apart, can carry different rising signs and, some days, different Moons. The date fixes the Sun’s story; the birth chart calculator tells the other nine-tenths from your time and place. The date, answered What zodiac sign is August 7? Leo. In every year from 1940 through 2030, the Sun is in Leo on August 7 — between"
