      "text": "respect: your name spelled correctly, your allergy remembered, the thing you mentioned once handled without follow-up. Exactness as affection The Capricorn Sun keeps its promises; the Mercury decan keeps them to the letter. January 13 people are the appointment kept to the minute, the quote checked before it’s repeated, the friend whose advice is specific enough to act on. There’s a moral seriousness under the detail-work — this date believes, without ever saying so, that getting small things right is how you prove you can be trusted with large ones. Their word functions like a signed document. High standards, both directions In love, that makes for a partner of rare consistency: what was promised happens, what was said is meant, anniversaries do"
