      "text": "bigger room. The household, redefined A Sun in Cancer always keeps a household; a Jupiter-toned one keeps expanding the definition. The new hire eating lunch alone, the neighbor’s kid, the friend of a friend between apartments — July 13 files them all under “ours.” Where early-July birthdays guard a perimeter, this one runs an embassy: the same protective instinct, now with an open-door policy. Bigger tables, bigger teams In love, July 13 builds family-of-choice around the partnership — holidays absorb newcomers, the guest list never quite closes. A partner who wants a sealed little world will struggle; one who wants a full house will thrive. At work this date leads by inclusion: teaching, community programs, the team lead who actually develops people rather than just scheduling them. Cancer with Jupiter behind it"
