      "text": "Birthdays Born on September 27 September 27 lands in Libra's opening decan, ruled by Venus twice over. The early diplomat in love and work, and the jury that won't rise. Sun sign Libra Balance-seeking, charming, allergic to unfairness. Exact date & cusp check Sun degrees, decan, and this year’s sky Sun sign Libra — every year, 1940–2030 Sun degrees 3°30′ Libra – 4°54′ Libra · noon UTC, 1940–2030 Decan first decan of Libra — traditional ruler Venus This year September 27, 2026: Sun 4°23′ Libra · Moon in Aries at noon UTC Four days into Libra, the sign’s opening argument is fully audible. September 27 belongs to Libra’s Venus-ruled first decan — the diplomatic stretch of a diplomatic sign — and it produces people other people bring their tangles to."
