      "text": "what lets it land. The record is kind on this point: the choices this date regrets are rarely the fast ones — they’re the ones that aged out while the weighing went on. The date hands you the Sun in Libra; the chart is where it gets personal. Which house hosts that diplomacy, what Moon sits underneath it — time and place decide, and the birth chart calculator reads both. The date, answered What zodiac sign is September 27? Libra. In every year from 1940 through 2030, the Sun is in Libra on September 27 — between 3°30′ Libra and 4°54′ Libra at noon universal time. Is September 27 on the cusp? No. Across 1940–2030 the Sun sits at least 3.5° inside Libra on September 27, so the sign never changes with the year. What decan is September 27? The first"
